              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "NimbleIce4375"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yeah… I used the 2 tablespoons of salt… Against my better judgement. I thought “is that right??” But I used that amount since that’s what the recipe called for, and they were extremely salty! Please fix that to 2 teaspoons.",
