            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Amanda"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wow, came out great! I added minced garlic, and extra flour but half the salt. I used my kitchen aid with the dough hook, used a rolling pin brushed some olive oil and pepper on both sides. I did this because I used an air fryer. 375° for 7 minutes made them perfect. I made Nava tacos!",
            "datePublished": "2025-07-18T12:57:56.629Z"
          },
