              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Hope"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These were good as Navajo tacos. However, we added only one tablespoon of salt and that was still too much. I think the person who submitted this may have meant to say two teaspoons of salt.",
            "datePublished": "2009-09-12T18:01:06.423Z"
